* TE PE014F03 bistable relay, coil only (spice.source: behavioral), written for this project.
* Ports: A1 A2. Contacts are not simulated (230 V side).
* RCOIL: datasheet 41 ohm +/-10 % at 20 C (notes/datasheets/pe014f03.md). The circuit uses the minimum,
* 36.9 ohm at 20 C = 37.9 ohm at the ngspice nominal 27 C, with the copper tempco 0.39 %/K (TC), so the
* 0 and 50 C runs see 33.9 and 41.2 ohm. The minimum resistance is the worst case for the coil voltage
* (largest drop in the bridge) and for the rail droop (largest current).
* LCOIL 0.1 H is an ESTIMATE (notes/parts.md); it only shapes the current rise (tau about 2.7 ms).
.subckt PE014F03_COIL a1 a2 params: RCOIL=37.9 LCOIL=0.1 TC=3.9e-3
Rc a1 m {RCOIL} tc1={TC}
Lc m a2 {LCOIL}
.ends PE014F03_COIL
